# Ars Magica Fifth Edition, Hermetic Projects — Front Matter and Back Cover (Lore)

**Version:** 0.5.0
**Source:** Hermetic Projects (Atlas Games) — Ars Magica Fifth Edition, credits (p. 2) and back cover (the cover spread, p. 1)
**Publisher:** Atlas Games

> The credits, verbatim, and the back cover, read from the cover spread’s text layer (it lies outside the
> page’s crop box, which shows only the front cover). The printed Contents (pp. 3–5, with the List of Inserts)
> is a finding aid for the book’s own pages and is not converted — every unit it lists is converted in its
> chapter. Pages 143–144 are advertisements with no text.

